+## G5 local compatibility overlay (2026-10-22)
+
+For `SingleContainerNodemanagerConfig.from_json`, a non-UCM second MultiConnector
+store reads `lookup_rpc_port` from the top-level key first, otherwise from
+`kv_connector_extra_config`, otherwise `0`. Convert with `int` and retain the
+role/index offset; a malformed explicit port still fails. UCM continues to skip
+this lookup. This is the G5 report's semantic reconstruction; the onsite full-file
+SHA was not supplied. Do not replace a different onsite fix based only on hashes.
+
+Regression: `bash tests/run_tests.sh --serial tests/node_manager/test_config.py`.
+The G5 added cases failed four times against the old code, then all 74 config tests
+passed with the overlay. See `bug-fix-history/node_manager/g5-nested-lookup-port.md`.
